## 💻 Repository Structure & Frontend Strategy

The repository follows a **Monorepo (Separate Directories)** structure:

```txt
Listening-Analytics/
├── docs/
│   └── postman/           # Official Postman Collections
│       └── listening-analytics.postman_collection.json
├── src/                   # Backend API (Express & GraphQL)
│   ├── controllers/
│   ├── graphql/
│   ├── services/
│   └── server.ts
└── (Future) frontend/     # Minimalist Web Dashboard (React/Next.js)
```

> **Note on Frontend:** A minimalist analytics dashboard (React / Chart.js) will be added in a separate `/frontend` directory to showcase the API visually for portfolio presentations, testing Client-Server integration and CORS without coupling Express to static assets.

